{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b3a9c49d7d47fae3e704cb1c6fc6b82b1fc0899fc20d1992c0047fb946d215fb", "ja": "（今日は紬の主演ミュージカルの衣装チェックだった。\nうん、バッチリ様になっているが……）", "zh": "（今天是紬主演的音乐剧的服装检查。\n嗯，穿起来非常合适，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5904831bea00875582a88c7995c625419c7459851d793d6fe208399b88b753d6", "ja": "動かしにくいところとかあれば、言ってくれ。\nミュージカルは動きが多いからな。", "zh": "如果有哪里不方便活动，就告诉我。\n音乐剧里的动作很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8593f8ab4a50dfce27230be2eb9c1fc21841dfc6ed23658b8a28237e5b2345d5", "ja": "はい。その点は問題ありません。\n元より、士官学校の制服と伺っていましたし……。", "zh": "是的，这方面没有问题。\n本来就听说这是军官学校的制服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cb2889d03603d98d6b677fb7a5d2799fbea8372c846015575f20a84ccd8ce0a2", "ja": "動きやすさは、折り紙付きかと。その上で、\n舞台衣装らしい煌びやかな装飾が随所に……。", "zh": "想必活动起来会很方便，舒适性是有保障的。而且，处处还点缀着舞台服装特有的华丽装饰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "12f3f50d9e76fe4630b87a2ffb3bbf72376797ce12e04a29a805c7682904881f", "ja": "本当に、素敵なお衣装ですね。\n袖を通す私の背筋も、自然と伸びてしまいます。", "zh": "真是件漂亮的服装呢。\n穿上它的我，背脊也不由得挺直了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a00f67ffa621220e34de49013bc8b71747f219f2bebdbd7d55f9dced5f0c795a", "ja": "うん、背筋を伸ばして着たほうが映える衣装だな。\nその点、紬は姿勢がいいから大丈夫だ！", "zh": "嗯，这身服装还是挺适合挺直腰板穿的。\n这点不用担心，紬的仪态很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8944569d42bdfdcb02e911360ac6a473339f72c07b3ca242d116c8ef73e2ae39", "ja": "それは、私が着物を着るからでは？", "zh": "那是因为我要穿和服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c9c04a975686f63c597ccd4fcf33f08fb8b8e9a26f3eccfc60bb2d0b5b8e0a65", "ja": "それだけじゃないと思うんだけどな……。あ、でも\n今回の役柄を考えると、もう少し猫背でもいいのかな？", "zh": "我觉得不只是因为这个……啊，不过\n考虑到这次的角色，是不是再稍微驼一点背比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1eda0cddfc4e5b0694c847c8836e81d43d8c3b510a3c34c3497818226638b0c7", "ja": "役柄……たしか私が演じるラファエルは、\nのんびりした性格の少年ですよね？", "zh": "角色……我记得我饰演的拉斐尔，\n是个性格悠闲的少年对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6a2f2742f656bb0f65a9d6f8a995f588d722cafad275a4e02b6b420d679c8547", "ja": "……つまり私には、余裕が足りない。\nいえ、それどころか……。", "zh": "……也就是说，我还不够从容。\n不，甚至可以说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "62fe2a28b259bba39a6f3ff59998e3f3a7fa05621a1f8f8ec6c02c654132a65d", "ja": "身も心も融通の利かない、頭の固い人間だと。\n貴方は、そう仰りたいのですか？", "zh": "您是想说，我是个身心都不知变通、思想顽固的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1011_p", "source_sha256": "520c4748b06d2321d015c69d9ce3b2564765e1935d541bae8222c4a356df700b", "ja": "いやいや、そうじゃなくて……。毎日幼馴染の\n女の子に起こしてもらうような、そんな子だろ？", "zh": "不不，不是那个意思……我是说，你是那种每天都让青梅竹马的女孩子叫你起床的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1012_p", "source_sha256": "80ee40419dfb0274830c470f0a8c2592c162d529d0a9e4398bfdea95f3953d4f", "ja": "ぐうたらしているとまでは言わないけど、どこか\n気の緩みみたいなものがあるんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "倒也不是说你懒散，只是我觉得，你是不是有点放松过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e1c5c5c57ace425abe79cba2e225f14245c754d7a0685381a1c58c2e6db00dce", "ja": "な……なるほど。なら、もう少し姿勢を崩して……\nし、姿勢を崩す……って、どうやるん……？", "zh": "原……原来如此。那就把姿势再放松一些……  \n放、放松姿势……具体要怎么做……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fdf153686fcf557061cf7246c3a7d59393c8377b70ff46010ed388c45c56965a", "ja": "（紬、考え込んでるな……。そうだ、後で紬が\n見返せるよう、動画に録っておくといいかもしれない）", "zh": "（紬正在苦思冥想呢……对了，录成视频的话，说不定之后紬就能回看了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fe6dacdc1059b4aff8265a4e0807455e66cce0c60db52012df40cd5b56d2f0c1", "ja": "ええと、たしかラファエルのセリフは……んんっ。", "zh": "那个，我记得拉斐尔的台词是……嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9388eaeb28d272500665fda118cbaf298c940da0b64faa02f5624fec11ab5181", "ja": "「はぁ、今日もくたびれたなぁ……。貴族って、\n毎日こんなに勉強しなくちゃならないの？」", "zh": "“哈啊，今天也累坏了呢……。贵族\n每天都必须学这么多东西吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "194b91253be55b9da6cb266d1763a88783b89d2e80cbc5bdbe2e20c72bb734dc", "ja": "「でも明日は休みだし、用事もないし……。\nお昼まで寝ちゃおーっと。へへっ♪」", "zh": "「不过明天休息，也没什么事……\n睡到中午好啦～嘿嘿♪」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "08c3e4bda9313b07bd660f2e25cc6e588a3a54b1729d0fbe9e54a9f9c5a5ad39", "ja": "……あの、こんな感じでいかがでしょう……っ！？\nな、な、何故貴方は、スマホのカメラをこちらに！？", "zh": "……那个，这样感觉怎么样……！？\n你、你、你为什么要把手机摄像头对着这边！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1019_p", "source_sha256": "82f3986c021b63491c9d6295380ea24830a215d766658f414900768795df33a8", "ja": "あ、ごめん。あとで見返せるようにと思って……\nでも今のは、いい具合に気が抜けていたと思うぞ！", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我是想着之后还能回看……不过刚才那样，我觉得你放松得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f6c88783bda59f00fee8bac510a898f3199b3d4b3765ca55d3cf94ad57335854", "ja": "こ、こちらの断りもなく……。\nいくらプロデューサーだからと、勝手に……。", "zh": "都、都不先征求我的同意……  \n就算您是制作人，也不能擅自……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b6eb77888d3639dae39d0cf1d8fc230b872062ebb25ba23ea9a6aa8b57cac42e", "ja": "ご、ごめん！　もう芝居が始まってたから、\n後でいいかと思って……。", "zh": "对、对不起！因为戏已经开始了，\n我想着待会儿再说也行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8c509bbc6efbadd6b0ef16510f5c10b1def393c8897b2be9006ed4b292e1e1a1", "ja": "は、恥ずかしいところを撮らないでください！\n……もう！　い、今すぐ消しまっし～！！", "zh": "请、请不要拍我难为情的样子！  \n……真是的！现、现在就删掉啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0504_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0504_1023_p", "source_sha256": "583aab901c1ccc8af14008950be5f1a44ad4a1395494d9a7930b5fda03a17799", "ja": "（確かに、紬の言う通りだ……。紬に共有したら、\n俺の端末からは削除しておこう……）", "zh": "（确实，正如紬所说……和紬分享之后，就从我的终端上删掉吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
